    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d385">

                <pb facs="0431" n="331" xml:id="pg331"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.156/26</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Paraguayan Minister</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gondra</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-13"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                        1919</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my recent
                    notes to you regarding the representations made to this Government by the
                    Construction and Engineering Finance Company of New York, concerning the alleged
                    premature termination of the concession granted to that company by the
                    Paraguayan Government for the improvement of the port and river front at
                    Asuncion. For your further information, I have the honor to inform you that the
                    Department has now received a letter from the Construction and Engineering
                    Finance Company, stating that it has finally made arrangements to secure the
                    necessary funds for carrying out its contract of concession at Asuncion and that
                    these funds will be available as soon as the Paraguayan Government shall have
                    indicated its agreement to the extension of time suggested by this Government in
                    my note to you of February 7, 1919.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Acting Secretary of State:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >William Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
